Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.86,0:00:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.40,0:01:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.24,0:02:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and struck Myotismon with her celestial\Narrow when he was finally beaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.94,0:02:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except, for some reason, his\Nmysterious fog hasn't lifted yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.56,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,330,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}{\fad(300,0)}Revival! The Devil, VenomVamdemon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.46,0:02:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That lousy fog barrier's still up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.46,0:02:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So beating Myotismon\Ndidn't solve anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.78,0:02:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.08,0:02:26.20,Sign,,0,0,270,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\c&H000000&\fs25\b1}You have e-mail.{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.52,0:02:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got mail from Gennai Wonderful news,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.70,0:02:32.21,Sign,,0,0,85,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\c&H000000&\b1}E-Mail from Gennai{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.70,0:02:32.21,Sign,,200,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\c&H000000&\b1\a1\fs15}From Gennai{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.70,0:02:32.21,Sign,,200,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\c&H000000&\b1\a1\fs15}To Koushiro{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.70,0:02:32.21,Sign,,100,0,245,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\c&H000000&\b1\a1\fs15}"Great News!"{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.70,0:02:32.21,Sign,,80,0,205,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\c&H000000&\b1\a1\fs15}You have received an animated{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.70,0:02:32.21,Sign,,240,0,190,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\c&H000000&\b1\a1\fs15}e-mail.{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.70,0:02:32.21,Sign,,80,0,125,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord0\c&H000000&\b1\a1\fs15}The attached file will\Nbe automatically decompressed.{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my friends I may have found the\Nway to defeat him once and for
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.96,0:02:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all Although this looks like a\Ngraham cracker It's actually an
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.18,0:02:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ancient text which I've translated\NThe sky will be darkened by the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.06,0:02:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wings of many bats The fallen\Npeople will invoke the name of the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.68,0:02:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,undead Digimon King And when the\Nclock strikes the hour of the beast
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.08,0:02:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The undead king will reveal himself\Nin his true form as the beast
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.18,0:02:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then angels will shoot arrows of\Nhope and light At the loved ones
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.78,0:02:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of those they've been sent to\Nprotect and a miracle will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.32,0:02:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please always recycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.54,0:03:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That last part seems weird, but good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.52,0:03:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was about as clear as mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.78,0:03:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you make heads or tails of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.26,0:03:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.76,0:03:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Tai, maybe we should\Ntry and find Mom and Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.90,0:03:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.94,0:03:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind checking\Nout my place either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'd like to change my pajamas,\Nor at least get a matching robe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.24,0:03:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.38,0:03:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No reason to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.70,0:03:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, can someone explain what's\Ngoing on? It's a pretty long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.38,0:03:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but i'll try hey everybody wait for me\Nsorry i'm late uh-huh are we missing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.76,0:03:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,somebody we're waiting for joe he's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.82,0:03:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,still upstairs mom dad there's no sign
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.16,0:03:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of anyone do you think they've been\Ncaptured with all the That would be sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.20,0:03:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.70,0:03:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax, it's only your brother\Nwho's totally freaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.00,0:03:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jim, what are you doing hiding in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.30,0:03:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not playing hide-and-seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those creepy things tore the place apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.48,0:04:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are creepy, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.04,0:04:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frankly, I wouldn't talk if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.08,0:04:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't worry about\Nthis little guy, Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.30,0:04:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I've got more good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.14,0:04:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myotismon's been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just who is Myotismon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.14,0:04:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For once in your life, Joe,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.06,0:04:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you actually sound like you know what\Nyou're talking about mm-hmm there's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.14,0:04:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a first time for everything find out\Nwhat's happening at the convention center
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.76,0:04:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we'll try to find a way\Nthrough the fog barrier right TK
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.86,0:04:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so tell me Joe are you still
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.96,0:04:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,planning on being a doctor Joe is
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.18,0:04:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,smart he could be a doctor there's\Na lot more to it than that Joe
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.10,0:04:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could be whatever he wants. It's\Nwhat my dad wants me to be. Poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.20,0:04:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dad he doesn't know no I'm not
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.80,0:04:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,saying he's that smart enough
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.56,0:04:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just saying it'll be kind of\Nhard for him to be a doctor when
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.46,0:04:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He passes out at the sight of\Nblood. Yep, that's my pal Joe. Look
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:05:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think your friends are coming\NWe'll talk about this later,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.90,0:05:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.00,0:05:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's one of them now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.56,0:05:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.26,0:05:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.17,0:05:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good work, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.62,0:05:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.78,0:05:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy, what's happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.72,0:05:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all so totally still. Are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.58,0:05:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, their pulses are normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.86,0:05:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.98,0:05:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.36,0:05:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.38,0:05:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to live it\Nyour way, not Dad's way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.70,0:05:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After I become a doctor,\NI'm going to South America,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.68,0:05:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Africa, someplace I can really be of help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.34,0:05:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad's already told me he doesn't approve.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.94,0:05:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.24,0:06:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, right now we've got to see to\Nall these people. What can we do if
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.54,0:06:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only we could get help from the\Noutside it's hopeless there's no way to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.68,0:06:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get through this fog hello anybody\Ncome out come out wherever you are no
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.76,0:06:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like this if you save us we'll give\Nyou anything you want including candy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.64,0:06:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nice try this just isn't working\Nmaybe we should go back to shore
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.72,0:06:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all our fault, Gatomon. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.72,0:06:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.63,0:06:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this spell or whatever it is will wear off
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.48,0:06:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then everyone will just wake up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.06,0:06:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.86,0:06:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.08,0:06:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.94,0:06:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, who's lost her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.70,0:06:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Bubbles!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.94,0:06:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were better off lost in the fog!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.80,0:06:47.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.71,0:06:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you insist!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.90,0:06:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.64,0:07:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.36,0:07:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.90,0:07:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened to them? Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.92,0:07:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sky will be darkened\Nby the wings of many bats.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.68,0:07:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now things start to get interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.02,0:07:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanted to talk to me? Yes, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.52,0:07:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you went off and\Nleft us there in hiding,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.74,0:07:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your mother and I thought we\Nmight never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.86,0:07:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we talked and decided the time had come
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.18,0:07:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to tell you that we're\Nnot your real parents,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.06,0:07:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.38,0:07:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.78,0:07:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard you talking once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.96,0:07:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I pretended to myself I\Nhadn't heard anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.58,0:07:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I made believe I had misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.66,0:07:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I tried to wipe it\Nfrom my mind and just
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:07:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,act like everything\Nwas the same as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.42,0:08:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it wasn't, and I didn't mean to,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.10,0:08:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I just started drifting away\Nfrom you a little more each day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.12,0:08:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you buried\Nyourself in that computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.74,0:08:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.42,0:08:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.54,0:08:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.36,0:08:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, in so many ways, you're\Nthe living image of your real father
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.24,0:08:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was my real father like?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.26,0:08:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was a fine man and a\Nbrilliant mathematician
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.04,0:08:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, he was a\Nlecturer at the university
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.38,0:08:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He and I were distant\Ncousins I was his only living
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.56,0:08:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,relative And your mother\Nhad no family of her own,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.62,0:08:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so when it happened
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.82,0:08:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Late one night, there was\Na terrible car accident
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.32,0:08:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neither of them survived
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.62,0:08:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we had lost a little\Nboy of our own you see
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.24,0:08:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just before so when we\Nwere asked if we might
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.16,0:08:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,want to take care of\Nyou well it seemed like
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.68,0:08:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i don't know some kind\Nof sign we said yes so
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.32,0:09:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you made me your son we\Nalways planned to tell
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.38,0:09:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you the truth we were\Njust waiting for you to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.46,0:09:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,grow up a little bit\Nmore but now you seem to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.54,0:09:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have found out on your\Nown we waited too long
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.52,0:09:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm sorry son no no dad there's no\Nneed for you to be sorry it couldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.82,0:09:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have been easy for you to tell\Nme all this and i'm well i'm glad
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.36,0:09:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you did we just want you to know\Nwe love you izzy you see as far
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.50,0:09:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as we're concerned you are our real\Nson nothing can ever change that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.82,0:09:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.08,0:09:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, it's times like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I had a Digi-mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.58,0:09:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zara!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.49,0:09:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your mom's away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.00,0:09:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Myotismon, Lord and Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.88,0:09:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.79,0:09:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.98,0:09:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.78,0:10:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to see you back on your feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.32,0:10:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.42,0:10:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need more. You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be long now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.02,0:10:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boss is going to be\Nbigger and better than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.90,0:10:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myotismon, Lord and Master. Stop it,\NDad! Snap out of it! Help! It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.58,0:10:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Very odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.92,0:10:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Physically, they're still asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.96,0:10:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like they're all\Nhaving the same dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.50,0:10:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.70,0:10:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember that prophecy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.22,0:10:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it fits.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.44,0:10:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says the fallen people will\Ninvoke the name of the undead king.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.80,0:11:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the first part about the\Nbats came true. Huh? When was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.04,0:11:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did the third part\Nof the prophecy say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.32,0:11:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before the recycle part, it was, when\Nthe clock strikes the hour of the beast,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the undead king will reveal\Nhimself in his true form.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.04,0:11:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terrific, but what's\Nthe hour of the beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.04,0:11:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six, six, six.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.38,0:11:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six seconds and six\Nminutes past six o 'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.12,0:11:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like triple six\Nis our unlucky number.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.18,0:11:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.90,0:11:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, get in the van!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.14,0:11:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're never going to make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.90,0:11:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.88,0:11:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that Myotismon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been taking steroids.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.94,0:11:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's his true form, the Beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.58,0:11:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.60,0:11:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight! Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.74,0:12:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon! Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.40,0:12:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.46,0:12:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, Digivolve to Garurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.88,0:12:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are my manners?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.38,0:12:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce you to the\Nnew and improved Venom Myotismon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.80,0:12:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Venom Myotismon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.30,0:12:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, the king of the undead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.12,0:12:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the un and you're the dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.74,0:12:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.78,0:12:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.78,0:12:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's all those people just\Nlying there waiting for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.74,0:12:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I owe this month, Lord and Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.40,0:12:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember to start your\Nday with a good breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.42,0:12:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll begin with a little snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.38,0:12:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hang on, what are you doing? Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.86,0:12:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going after everyone\Nat the convention center.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.58,0:12:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pump it up, you guys, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.86,0:12:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard them, let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.78,0:12:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.78,0:13:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon Digimon 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon Digimon 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.36,0:13:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Koromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.26,0:13:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.78,0:13:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we flip a coin\Nto see who goes first?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me! Giga Destroyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.22,0:13:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wolf Claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.30,0:13:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't even phase it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.18,0:13:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garuru Kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.18,0:14:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claw, the Giga Destroyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.08,0:14:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.72,0:14:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.44,0:14:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must be!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.62,0:14:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That answer your question?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.96,0:14:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, Tai, go to the convention\Ncenter and warn the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.60,0:14:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about us, we'll\Ntake care of this clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.70,0:14:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, but just watch yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.04,0:14:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pizza tank!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.50,0:14:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.54,0:14:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.92,0:14:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clear everyone out, now! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.66,0:14:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how long\Nthey can hold them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.76,0:14:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we had time, we\Ncouldn't move all these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.38,0:14:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.52,0:14:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can never outrun him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.68,0:14:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.04,0:14:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can count on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.34,0:14:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and that's two.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.48,0:14:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.44,0:14:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, make that four. Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.58,0:14:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon's the only Digimon\NI need to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.82,0:14:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest of you stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.98,0:15:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, nothing personal. I\Njust want all of you to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.98,0:15:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,save up your strength\Nif my plan doesn't work
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.56,0:15:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll all be needed\Nlet's do what she says
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.48,0:15:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she knows these bad\Ndigimon better than anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,excuse me i don't mean to\Nbe a downer or anything
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.72,0:15:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but how can any of us\Nhope to stand up against
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.84,0:15:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that guy he's bigger\Nthan most buildings i've
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.56,0:15:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,got a plan like i said\Ncome on patamon let's fly
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.42,0:15:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're right behind you got him on let's\Ngo son we're in this together right right
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.64,0:15:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon, Digivolve, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.50,0:15:34.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.04,0:15:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon, Digivolve, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.46,0:15:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.32,0:15:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.54,0:15:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.04,0:15:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kinda complicated.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.63,0:15:53.59,Sign,,0,0,115,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1\c&HDCA7C8&}Angemon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.63,0:15:53.59,Sign,,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.63,0:15:53.59,Sign,,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Vaccine
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.63,0:15:53.59,Sign,,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Angel Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.63,0:15:53.59,Sign,,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.63,0:15:53.59,Sign,,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Heaven's Knuckle
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.70,0:15:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Digivolve, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.40,0:15:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon is the fully evolved version of\NPatamon and Angemon is the same for Gatomon.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.59,0:15:59.56,Sign,,0,0,115,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1\c&HDCA7C8&}Angewomon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.59,0:15:59.56,Sign,,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.59,0:15:59.56,Sign,,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Vaccine
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.59,0:15:59.56,Sign,,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Angel Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.59,0:15:59.56,Sign,,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.59,0:15:59.56,Sign,,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Holy Arrow
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:15:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.66,0:15:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, trust me on this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.90,0:16:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice to have outside interests, but\NI hope your schoolwork hasn't suffered.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.60,0:16:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, this is the fate of the\Nplanet we're dealing with,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.74,0:16:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the survival of the human race.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.22,0:16:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I can take a makeup\Ntest for anything I missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.86,0:16:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure wish I'd brought the camcorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.70,0:16:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.64,0:16:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.18,0:16:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have drained them of their energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.14,0:16:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, small fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.10,0:16:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.74,0:16:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the bait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.20,0:16:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.92,0:16:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody ever said it would be, Angemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.26,0:16:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall enjoy devouring you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.52,0:16:57.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The new Angemon is one of my favorites.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.48,0:17:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Matt, we tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.02,0:17:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was too much for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.94,0:17:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is that monster so much bigger\Nthan the other Digimon? Search me.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.25,0:17:13.26,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}VenomVamdemon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.25,0:17:13.26,Sign,,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ultimate
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.25,0:17:13.26,Sign,,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.25,0:17:13.26,Sign,,380,0,230,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Undead Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.25,0:17:13.26,Sign,,380,0,305,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.25,0:17:13.26,Sign,,380,0,345,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Venom Infuse
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.18,0:17:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.09,0:17:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it was fully evolved,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.26,0:17:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he found some way of digivolving\Ninto an even higher level.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.50,0:17:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some kind of mega ultimate level.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.60,0:17:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.80,0:17:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like changing the rules\Nin the middle of a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.50,0:17:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it, you're tickling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.32,0:17:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.52,0:17:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.02,0:17:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, the prophecy, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.10,0:17:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, Izzy, what did it\Nsay in there about angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.94,0:17:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does the prophecy say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.66,0:17:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angels will shoot arrows\Nof hope and light at the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.46,0:17:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,loved ones of those they\Nhave been sent to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.30,0:17:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a miracle will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.64,0:17:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, if Angemon and Angemon are\Nthe angels in the prophecy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.44,0:17:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then who are the ones\Nthey've been sent to protect?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.56,0:17:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must mean TK and Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.44,0:17:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The angels will shoot\Narrows at their loved ones.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.38,0:17:56.59,Sign,,0,360,180,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&}Angel
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.38,0:17:59.34,Sign,,0,0,210,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&}Person to protect
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.38,0:18:02.81,Sign,,500,0,120,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&}Person that person\Nloves most
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.36,0:17:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.27,0:17:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.24,0:17:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say I'm kind of like a guardian angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.06,0:17:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whose guardian angel am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.46,0:18:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who do you love the most?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.72,0:18:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was getting to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.32,0:18:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mom and dad, obviously.\NExactly. But T .K.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.30,0:18:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Kari not only have moms and\Ndads, they have something else, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.58,0:18:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.86,0:18:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a word, bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.34,0:18:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you want them shooting\Narrows at your loved ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.96,0:18:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds dangerous to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.14,0:18:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're angels, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.08,0:18:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're like Cupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.40,0:18:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was sort of an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.86,0:18:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he shot arrows,\Nthey were arrows of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.00,0:18:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom, isn't that a little corny?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.86,0:18:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may be corny, but I buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.20,0:18:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we've got to do is\Nget Angemon and Angemon
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.56,0:18:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to hit you guys with their arrows of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.22,0:18:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's not be too hasty here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.30,0:18:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's worth a shot. Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure you wanna?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.82,0:18:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see these arrows of hope and light.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.00,0:18:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two have got to get\Nthem to shoot at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll only do it if you tell them to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.90,0:18:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really want him to shoot you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.98,0:18:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if you get, like, dead or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.14,0:18:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never happen, right? Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.94,0:18:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.60,0:18:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angewomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.52,0:18:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.58,0:19:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this maybe sounds crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.24,0:19:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But shoot Matt and Tai with your arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.78,0:19:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You too, Angewomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.84,0:19:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.70,0:19:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds crazy, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.34,0:19:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.12,0:19:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if that prophecy's all wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.00,0:19:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys want a miracle to happen or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.56,0:19:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, miracles require a little faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.50,0:19:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scared, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.02,0:19:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.46,0:19:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you, Matt?\NCourse not. Piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.20,0:19:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But maybe I'll just hang on to you to make\Nsure you don't chicken out or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.28,0:19:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.19,0:19:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do the same for you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.04,0:19:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One miracle! Coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.70,0:19:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.94,0:19:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, Warp Digivolve! Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon monsters,\NDigimon are the Junkins!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.88,0:20:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,WarGreymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.28,0:20:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.72,0:20:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.63,0:20:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.94,0:20:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.16,0:20:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you go to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.38,0:20:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.40,0:20:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.56,0:20:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon you're the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.18,0:20:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The champions! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.28,0:20:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.82,0:20:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Garuru, bye! The\Nchampions! The champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.68,0:20:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One! Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.06,0:21:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is always the way I want to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.60,0:21:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.52,0:21:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.72,0:21:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep going, thank\Nyou. I'll keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.60,0:21:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.12,0:21:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.78,0:21:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.08,0:21:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no longer there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.99,0:21:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.91,0:21:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.90,0:21:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no longer you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.81,0:21:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.73,0:21:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.64,0:21:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.75,0:21:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a weak person
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.58,0:21:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to get one more time. I'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.04,0:21:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,able to be strong in
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.78,0:21:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart. I'll be able
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.96,0:21:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To fly with my courage.\NI'll be able to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.80,0:21:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart. I'll be able
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.28,0:22:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To see my future. Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.16,0:22:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.04,0:22:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still starting to be a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.38,0:22:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.74,0:22:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.65,0:22:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.16,0:22:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the season!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.07,0:22:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end of the season!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.99,0:22:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end of the season!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.90,0:22:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end of the season!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.81,0:22:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be back again at\Nthe end of the season!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.74,0:22:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they're strong and powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.48,0:22:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I won't go to the end of the season!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.50,0:22:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world is important!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.94,0:22:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to be one of the best Chosen!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.46,0:22:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end of the season!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.10,0:22:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're finally here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.01,0:22:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the last battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.93,0:22:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.84,0:22:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon Adventure!
